[ 2026-10-08 22:14:26,862 ] groq._base_client - DEBUG - Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/openai/v1/chat/completions', 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-4554be87-e71c-407b-97df-bf96c766ea0e', 'json_data': {'messages': [{'role': 'system', 'content': "You are an expert Mechanical Engineering Assistant.\n\nProblem Categories: ['hvac_load', 'thermodynamics']\nTarget Operations: ['sensible_heat']\nExtracted Parameters: {'mass_flow_rate': 2.0, 'specific_heat': 1005.0, 'temperature_difference': 10.0}\nAssociated Units: {'mass_flow_rate': 'kg/s', 'specific_heat': 'J/(kg·K)', 'temperature_difference': '°C'}\n\nInstructions:\n1. Review the target operations and extracted parameters along with their specific units.\n2. Convert parameter units if needed before performing calculations.\n3. Invoke the necessary calculation/conversion tools using the exact numerical values and appropriate units.\n4. If multiple operations are required, execute all relevant tools in proper sequence.\n5. Do not invent or fabricate missing parameters.\n"}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'An HVAC system supplies air at a mass flow rate of 2 kg/s. The specific heat of air is 1005 J/(kg·K), and the temperature difference is 10°C. Calculate the sensible heat load.'}], 'model': 'openai/gpt-oss-120b', 'n': 1, 'reasoning_effort': None, 'reasoning_format': None, 'service_tier': 'on_demand', 'stop': None, 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0.7, 'tools': [{'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'thermodynamics', 'description': 'Solve basic thermodynamic calculations.\n\n---------------------------------------------------------\nSIGN CONVENTION\n---------------------------------------------------------\n\nThe First Law is written as:\n\n    ΔU = Q - W\n\nwhere:\n\n    ΔU = change in internal energy [J]\n    Q  = heat added to the system [J]\n    W  = work done BY the system [J]\n\nTherefore:\n\n    Q = ΔU + W\n\n    W = Q - ΔU\n\nPositive Q:\n    Heat enters the system.\n\nPositive W:\n    System performs work on the surroundings.\n\n---------------------------------------------------------\n1. WORK\n---------------------------------------------------------\n\nFor constant pressure boundary work:\n\n    W = P * ΔV\n\nwhere:\n\n    P  = pressure [Pa]\n    ΔV = volume change [m^3]\n\nPositive ΔV means expansion and positive work.\n\n---------------------------------------------------------\n2. HEAT\n---------------------------------------------------------\n\nFirst Law:\n\n    Q = ΔU + W\n\nFor a substance heated without phase change:\n\n    Q = m * c * ΔT\n\nIf sufficient information is provided, the tool uses:\n\n    Q = m*c*ΔT\n\nOtherwise, when internal energy change and work\nare provided:\n\n    Q = ΔU + W\n\n---------------------------------------------------------\n3. INTERNAL ENERGY\n---------------------------------------------------------\n\nFirst Law:\n\n    ΔU = Q - W\n\nFor a simple sensible-heating process:\n\n    ΔU = m*c_v*ΔT\n\nHere `specific_heat` is treated as the appropriate\nspecific heat for the supplied problem.\n\n---------------------------------------------------------\n4. ENTHALPY\n---------------------------------------------------------\n\n    H = U + PV\n\nTherefore:\n\n    ΔH = ΔU + Δ(PV)\n\nFor constant pressure:\n\n    ΔH = ΔU + P*ΔV\n\nFor sensible heating using a specific heat:\n\n    ΔH = m*c_p*ΔT\n\n---------------------------------------------------------\n5. EFFICIENCY\n---------------------------------------------------------\n\n    efficiency = useful output / input\n\nTherefore:\n\n    eta = E_out / E_in\n\nor, if efficiency is already known:\n\n    E_out = eta * E_in\n\nEfficiency is returned as a decimal between 0 and 1.\n\nUnits:\n\n    pressure       -> Pa\n    volume_change  -> m^3\n    heat/work      -> J\n    mass           -> kg\n    specific_heat  -> J/(kg*K)\n    temperature    -> K or deg C difference\n    enthalpy       -> J\n    internal energy -> J', 'parameters': {'properties': {'operation': {'enum': ['work', 'heat', 'internal_energy', 'enthalpy', 'efficiency'], 'type': 'string'}, 'heat': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'number'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None}, 'work': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'number'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None}, 'pressure': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'number'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None}, 'volume_change': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'number'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None}, 'mass': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'number'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None}, 'specific_heat': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'number'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None}, 'temperature_change': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'number'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None}, 'internal_energy_initial': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'number'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None}, 'internal_energy_final': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'number'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None}, 'enthalpy_initial': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'number'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None}, 'enthalpy_final': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'number'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None}, 'efficiency_value': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'number'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None}, 'energy_input': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'number'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None}, 'energy_output': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'number'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None}}, 'required': ['operation'], 'type': 'object'}}}, {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'hvac_load', 'description': 'Estimate basic HVAC heating and cooling loads.\n\n---------------------------------------------------------\n1. SENSIBLE HEAT\n---------------------------------------------------------\n\n    Q_sensible = m_dot * cp * ΔT\n\nwhere:\n\n    m_dot = air mass flow rate [kg/s]\n    cp    = specific heat [J/(kg*K)]\n    ΔT    = temperature difference [K]\n\n---------------------------------------------------------\n2. LATENT HEAT\n---------------------------------------------------------\n\n    Q_latent = m_dot_water * h_fg\n\nwhere:\n\n    m_dot_water = moisture condensation/evaporation rate [kg/s]\n    h_fg        = latent heat of vaporization [J/kg]\n\n---------------------------------------------------------\n3. TRANSMISSION LOAD\n---------------------------------------------------------\n\n    Q_transmission = U * A * ΔT\n\nwhere:\n\n    U  = overall heat-transfer coefficient [W/(m²*K)]\n    A  = building area [m²]\n    ΔT = indoor/outdoor temperature difference [K]\n\n---------------------------------------------------------\n4. VENTILATION / INFILTRATION SENSIBLE LOAD\n---------------------------------------------------------\n\n    Q_ventilation = rho * V_dot * cp * ΔT\n\nwhere:\n\n    rho   = air density [kg/m³]\n    V_dot = volumetric airflow rate [m³/s]\n\n---------------------------------------------------------\n5. COOLING LOAD\n---------------------------------------------------------\n\n    Q_cooling =\n        transmission\n        + ventilation\n        + internal_sensible\n        + solar\n        + latent\n\n---------------------------------------------------------\n6. HEATING LOAD\n---------------------------------------------------------\n\n    Q_heating =\n        transmission\n        + ventilation\n\n    If heating_efficiency < 1:\n\n        Required heater input =\n            Q_heating / efficiency\n\n---------------------------------------------------------\nUnits\n---------------------------------------------------------\n\n    Heat/load       -> W\n    Area            -> m²\n    U-value         -> W/(m²*K)\n    Temperature     -> K or °C difference\n    Air flow        -> m³/s\n    Mass flow       -> kg/s\n    Specific heat   -> J/(kg*K)\n    Latent heat     -> J/kg', 'parameters': {'properties': {'operation': {'enum': ['cooling_load', 'heating_load', 'sensible_heat', 'latent_heat'], 'type': 'string'}, 'area': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'number'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None}, 'temperature_difference': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'number'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None}, 'mass_flow_rate': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'number'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None}, 'specific_heat': {'default': 1005.0, 'type': 'number'}, 'moisture_mass_flow_rate': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'number'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None}, 'latent_heat_vaporization': {'default': 2500000.0, 'type': 'number'}, 'thermal_transmittance': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'number'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None}, 'air_flow_rate': {'anyOf': [{'type': 'number'}, {'type': 'null'}], 'default': None}, 'air_density': {'default': 1.2, 'type': 'number'}, 'internal_sensible_load': {'default': 0.0, 'type': 'number'}, 'internal_latent_load': {'default': 0.0, 'type': 'number'}, 'solar_load': {'default': 0.0, 'type': 'number'}, 'heating_efficiency': {'default': 1.0, 'type': 'number'}}, 'required': ['operation'], 'type': 'object'}}}]}}
